1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:03,884
One doom capacitor left
in the whole city.

2
00:00:03,924 --> 00:00:06,021
It's Black Friday.

3
00:00:08,841 --> 00:00:11,580
Which is why
we brought a rocket.

4
00:00:11,620 --> 00:00:15,389
Cleo. On three.
One... two...

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,116
Hey! No cutting!

6
00:00:18,156 --> 00:00:19,706
Happy Black Fri—

7
00:00:20,226 --> 00:00:22,062
DOORBUSTER!

8
00:00:24,955 --> 00:00:27,481
Got it! The last one!

9
00:00:27,521 --> 00:00:29,705
I ordered one online.

10
00:00:29,745 --> 00:00:32,114
...Then why are we here?

11
00:00:32,154 --> 00:00:34,878
You said "rocket."

12
00:00:35,748 --> 00:00:37,506
CLEO!
